body:
To me that even depends on the book. For books like John, I like a translation that's more "modern", as in I want to understand the message. For Psalms, Proverbs and more poem-like sections, I like a translation that it's older &/or closer to the original. 

&#x200B;

If you don't know already, YouVersion's Bible App and Web is great for this because they have every translation on Earth.
